{"section":{"id":"cet4-2026-06-set1-news-report-1","examId":"cet4-2026-06-set1","title":"新闻 1","kind":"新闻","start":40.83,"end":107.46,"preview":"A man was left with a $1,000 bill after his six-year-old son ordered a virtual buffet of food from several restaurants last weekend.","lines":[{"start":40.83,"end":50.99,"text":"A man was left with a $1,000 bill after his six-year-old son ordered a virtual buffet of food from several restaurants last weekend."},{"start":50.99,"end":59.23,"text":"This led to a string of unexpected deliveries and maybe a starring role in an advertisement campaign."},{"start":59.23,"end":69.15,"text":"Keith Stonehouse said the food piled up quickly at his home Saturday night after he let his son use his cell phone to play a game before bed."},{"start":69.15,"end":78.43,"text":"He said the youngster instead used his father's online food ordering account to order food from one restaurant after another."},{"start":78.43,"end":89.15,"text":"The boy's mother, Kristin Stonehouse, said that the online food app has reached out to the family and offered them a $1,000 gift card."},{"start":89.15,"end":96.19,"text":"The company also is considering using the family in an online promotional campaign."},{"start":96.19,"end":100.19,"text":"Most of the food went into the family's refrigerators."},{"start":100.19,"end":104.03,"text":"They also invited some neighbors over to eat some of it."},{"start":104.03,"end":107.46,"text":"The father is planning to change his password."}],"audio":"assets/audio/150e1800ece87f04f4a1d6fd0ae1852c1eb07ca4fb1cf81380540c27eb88b514.wav","audioOffset":40.83},"tasks":[{"id":"0-0","text":"A man was left with a $1,000 bill after his six-year-old son ordered a virtual buffet of food from several restaurants last weekend.","start":40.83,"end":50.99,"legacyTaskIds":["0-0"],"legacyTaskIndices":[0],"sentenceVisual":{"type":"时间","icon":"clock-3","image":"assets/images/739358b5e9099a707d950a3fd85688a39515d2447ea4e8c6962d0803201fd708.webp","